    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>In-Class Worksheets, iLearn Quizzes, Homework, Attendance &amp; Participation (課堂工作單、iLeran 小考、作業、出席及課堂參與) 30%;&nbsp;4 Quizzes (4個紙本小考) 30%; Midterm Exam (期中考) 20%; Final Exam (期末考) 20%.&nbsp;&nbsp;All assignments are due at the beginning of the class. (所有作業需在一開始上課時繳交。) Late homework will not be accepted. (遲交的作業不予計分。) Unexcused Absence -1 point/hour (無故出席每小時扣一分。) Tardy -0.5 points/class (遲到每堂課扣0.5分。) Excellent Attendance (No absences) +3 points (全勤並且無遲到紀錄，學期總成績加3分。) Cell phones can only be used under the direction of the instructor for academic activities. (在老師的指導下，基於課堂上的學習活動，學生方可使用手機。)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
